{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless bullets!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you move using <strong>just the mouse</strong> to avoid any and all projectiles that come your way. After a few seconds of surviving the bullet pattern, a target will appear. Either wait out the attack timer or click the target to advance to a new, randomly selected bullet pattern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras/0f1f42443e859834df674fb3623667d1.avif?t=1738559002\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras_big/0f1f42443e859834df674fb3623667d1.avif?t=1738559002 width=800 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can, beat bosses, secure helpful meta-progression upgrades, and ascend back to the Heavens to reclaim your home!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A main story with a roster of unique and charming characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras/32af7d7ed0a38a2a65bbcd500fc3f5bc.avif?t=1738559002\" width=580 height=250 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >54 unique bullet patterns (which can then be given additional modifiers!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras/888a3417ab0b2716b9629ee3a86b7396.avif?t=1738559002\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras_big/888a3417ab0b2716b9629ee3a86b7396.avif?t=1738559002 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 challenging bosses to conquer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras/0c47b7831a77dc47a95b63d085912fe0.avif?t=1738559002\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras_big/0c47b7831a77dc47a95b63d085912fe0.avif?t=1738559002 width=800 height=416 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A practice mode to hone your skills!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras/bab8f65c48bfed6a9381bcad21d00ee1.avif?t=1738559002\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras_big/bab8f65c48bfed6a9381bcad21d00ee1.avif?t=1738559002 width=800 height=310 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta-progression that unlocks new mechanics: including weapons, special attacks, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras/283af97f3d16c6de58ecf6bf4f4370f5.avif?t=1738559002\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras_big/283af97f3d16c6de58ecf6bf4f4370f5.avif?t=1738559002 width=800 height=204 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >77 achievements to collect!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Other fun stuff! (Secrets, MTX-free cosmetics, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1977730/extras/70d4a2283cea7adc9341c2eca9687c9f.avif?t=1738559002\" width=616 height=650 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>